@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 11. Security Model

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Security Flow" {
  [AuthService] as AuthFilter
  [Auth Session Redis] as AuthStore
  [HumanMessageService] as HumanMessageService
  [AuditLogger] as AuditLogger
}

AuthFilter --> AuthStore
AuthFilter --> HumanMessageService
AuthFilter --> AuditLogger

note right of AuthFilter
Validate by
- sessionId
- ttl/expiry
- scope/role
- required request fields
end note

note bottom of HumanMessageService
Return HUMAN_MESSAGE on
- session not found
- expired session
- permission denied
end note

note bottom of AuditLogger
Do not log
- token
- raw prompt secrets
- internal redis keys
- full mcp payload
end note

note left of AuthStore
Security rules
- least privilege access
- ttl validation
- key prefix isolation
end note

@enduml
